.Dd August 22, 2026
.Dt PQFREEBSD 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm pqfreebsd
.Nd umbrella rc.d for ledger and repaired DAC on FreeBSD MAC
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm oneinstall | onesnapshot | onestage | onesnapshot_after | onestart |
.Cm oneenforce | oneuninstall | test Ns Ar cmd
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the suite installer.
ZFS recursive snapshots
.Pq filesystems and zvols
happen only here, before and after staging.
There is no
.Xr bectl 8
integration.
Children
.Nm pqledger
and
.Nm pqdac ,
and the parent
.Nm mac_grok
packages if installed, skip their own snapshots.
.Pp
.Va pqfreebsd_enable
defaults to
.Dq NO .
Use
.Xr service 8
.Cm one*
prefixes.
Do not
.Cm enforce
until a root console and a clean parent
.Cm checklabels .
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Pa /usr/local/etc/rc.d/pqfreebsd
.It Pa /usr/local/etc/pqfreebsd/
.It Pa /var/db/pqfreebsd/PREINSTALL/
.It Pa /var/db/pqfreebsd/zfs.snaps
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr pqac 7 ,
.Xr pqfreebsd 7 ,
.Xr pqledger 8 ,
.Xr pqdac 8 ,
.Xr mac_grok 8 ,
.Xr zfs 8
